'''Sulphur''' is an {{Uncommon}} collection item and crafting ingredient, obtained from [[Sulphur Ore]] found on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Collection ==
Collecting Sulphur increases the player's Sulphur [[Collections|Collection]], which unlocks the recipes for certain items upon collecting certain amounts of pieces of Sulphur.

{{/Collection UI}}
{{CollectionTable|Sulphur}}

== Obtaining ==
=== Mining ===
After the [[Blazing Volcano]] erupts, Sulphur Ore is scattered all over the [[Crimson Isle]]. It appears as {{Item|Sponge}}, and requires tools with {{stat|breaking power|8}} to mine. Each block mined gives {{Item|Sulphur|amount=1}}, affected by {{Stat|Mining fortune}}.

=== Mob Drops ===
'''Sulphur''' can also be obtained by killing {{Corrupted}} mobs. Each {{Corrupted}} mob will drop {{Item|Sulphur|amount=1}}.

Some mobs can additionally drop '''Sulphur''':
{{Drop Sources}}

=== Minions ===
'''Sulphur''' is generated by [[Minions]] when a {{Item|Corrupt Soil}} is applied to them.

